# Architectural debt that `deslop-please --allow .deslop-please.allow` still
# tolerates, run from `mqttiumd/` (deslop-please 0.1.3). Recorded on 23
# November 2026 at 290db2b, 87 entries; each lot of branch
# `refactor/deslop-layers` removes the entries it fixes. An entry still here is
# not fixed.
#
# Kept on purpose, with their reason:
# - long-file, wide-directory: splitting the long files re-points about 125
#   citations of conformance/server-statements.json and the replays of the
#   models, which CI checks; the structural lots change which files are long.
#   Decided after them.
# - shallow-module mqttiumd_store_api: `DurableStore` is the port every store
#   implements (eleven implementations); a trait that is the interface shows
#   its methods. Removing one method does not make it deep.
# - shallow-module mqttiumd_contract: a contract crate shows its types. Moving
#   the generic maps out (a crate of their own) reverses record 0057 and is a
#   separate proposal.
# - field-leak mqttiumd_lab::bench::collector::Collector::lines: the child
#   relays the records its collector wrote, byte for byte, and reads each one
#   again for its origin and kind; loop mutant n1 is anchored on that reading.
#   Handing the buffer to a closure instead is the same lending, and the
#   linter says so.
# - field-leak mqttiumd_lab::store::adapter::SimStore::store: the inspector
#   of the backend reads the durable state beside the adapter, unrecorded and
#   unfaulted, by design. Every other use goes through the adapter.
#
# The other entries are fixed lot by lot. After lot 1 (lab): 78 entries;
# after lot 2 (contract): 75; after lot 3 (stores): 65.
# - field-leak of the effective settings (SqliteStore::settings,
#   LogStore::sqlite_settings, VolatileHandle::sqlite_settings): a record of
#   what the engine read back, which every reader only copies; its main
#   reader is the writer of the runtime. Decided with the runtime lot.
module-cycle mqttiumd::codec,mqttiumd::net,mqttiumd::security
module-cycle mqttiumd_core::owner::pubsub,mqttiumd_core::owner::receipts,mqttiumd_core::owner::routing,mqttiumd_core::owner::sessions,mqttiumd_core::owner::will
field-leak mqttiumd::net::reactor::Shared::dead
field-leak mqttiumd::net::reactor::Shared::held
